    {
      "factor": "breaks_and_shifts",
      "why": "Breaks, lunches and shift changes WITHIN a working day are not modeled: a crew works continuously from the moment its day opens until its whistle. The day itself is modeled \u2014 a working-day length, a release cadence, and a receiving crew with hours of its own \u2014 so what is absent is the structure inside a shift, not the shift."
    },
    {
      "factor": "inter_aisle_travel",
